 "html": "<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1730183358082\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/39459a175a9c4b0bbbc99637c32378d7_1730183358082_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">In this patch, meet two heroes who have been infected by an unknown substance and have come to have an eerie atmosphere.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Weapon Hex</span>, an experimental subject created to use magic in combat, has gotten a Tier-4 Advancement and a new Uniform.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Abomination</span>, a former soldier who gained superpowers after being exposed to gamma rays, has received a Tier-3 Advancement and a new Uniform.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated hero</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by downloading the 10/29 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 10/29 Patch Details</span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 10/30 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 10/29 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[10/30&nbsp;(Wed) 3:04&nbsp;(UTC+0), 10/29&nbsp;(Tue) 20:04&nbsp;(PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 10/30 (Wed) 3:04&nbsp;(UTC+0), 10/29 (Tue) 20:04&nbsp;(PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Two New Uniforms &amp; Uniform Improvements</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">1. Two new Uniforms, Weapon Hex &lt;Infected Bioweapon&gt; and Abomination &lt;Infected Bioweapon&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 10/29 Patch data has been applied.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ef007c\">* The new Uniforms, Weapon Hex &lt;Infected Bioweapon&gt; and Abomination &lt;Infected Bioweapon&gt; can be purchased during the event.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">▶ Weapon Hex &lt;Infected Bioweapon&gt;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">After the 10/29 Patch - 11/15 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">After the 10/29 Patch - 11/15 (Fri) 6:59 (PST)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"border:none; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Token Shop with Creepy Halloween Token</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"border:none; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">- Creepy Halloween Tokens can be acquired by purchasing event products or through other methods until 11/12 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0) / 6:59 (PST).</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* Creepy Halloween Tokens are not included in products in the Web Shop.</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"border:none; margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style